{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064263/block/singleImage/3269924/df/01M7MEV24DFND8PTD673FBSN94.jpg?updatedAt=1794909350\"/><figcaption>大埔運頭塘邨運來樓。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>大埔有人懷疑猝死。 今日（17日）早上11時25分，一名53歲姓區女子懷疑於大埔運頭塘邨運來樓家中暈倒，其家人報警求助。警方和救援人員接報後到場，消防破門而入，發現女子已經明顯死亡。警方將案件列「屍體發現」，稍後將安排為事主驗屍確定死因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:32:19.431192+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:55:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:42.811377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:42.811377+00:00","content_hash":"b40ec850030fbddf0011802f116d15d5218d4d722087fb39b2263f3e11817026","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}